ters into their world. \n- Explore independent ideas: Discover bold opinions and engaging views across food, sports, politics, fashion, comedy, finance, and more.\n\nHow it works:\n1. Download the Substack app.\n2. Claim your handle.\n3. Explore the feed to enjoy notes, videos, and clips from creators. \n4. Subscribe to your favorites for free, tune into their livestreams and join private group chats.","released":"2022-03-08","updated":"2026-10-28","icon":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple221/v4/cc/c4/4d/ccc44d95-ac70-1ebe-3bfd-2ca06b210442/AppIcon-0-0-1x_U007epad-0-0-0-1-0-0-P3-85-220.png/512x512bb.jpg","age":"17+"},"android":null,"icon":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple221/v4/cc/c4/4d/ccc44d95-ac70-1ebe-3bfd-2ca06b210442/AppIcon-0-0-1x_U007epad-0-0-0-1-0-0-P3-85-220.png/512x512bb.jpg","cat":"News & Reading","rating":4.87,"ratings":562398,"mentions":1,"users":1,"threads":1,"hn_points":0,"hn_comments":0,"submissions":0,"self_n":0,"hn_score":2.0,"first":1646950376,"last":1646950376,"show_hn":null,"n_lab":1,"pos_pct":0,"neg_pct":0,"mood":null,"quotes":[{"id":30633208,"k":"ios:1581650857","type":"comment","by":"mccorrinall","time":1646950376,"text":"https://on.substack.com/p/substackapp\n\nhttps://apps.apple.com/de/app/substack-reader/id1581650857?l=en","title":null,"story_id":30632952,"story_title":"We’re the founders of Substack, we just launched an iOS app. AUA","story_score":374,"comments":0,"w":1.0,"u":0,"s":"neu","self":false}],"slug":"substack"}